      "content": "everything i ever cared about is just... crumbling. it’s like watching a forest burn in slow motion. you can see the smoke on the horizon and you know there's nothing you can do to stop it. it feels so pointless to just sit here and wait for the embers to go out. why even stay to watch the wreckage?",
