      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just \"overwhelmed.\" it's the realization that everything beautiful is temporary and usually ends in something ugly. why do we force ourselves to endure the decay? it feels almost cruel to have to watch the slow death of things. wouldn't it be more dignified to just... step away before it gets completely hideous?",
